            "detailed_description": "<h1>Adiciona o meu novo jogo à tua lista de desejos – NO LIFE: Zombie Survivor</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/27f40acd43b191700a5693950dc7d2ba.avif?t=1778784716\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/e7b8cbf438a6b67aa3168fd20379672e.avif?t=1778784716\" width=614 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/369b863b5e236f5f2be3f4703ea2d6f4.webp?t=1778784716\" width=18 height=18 /></span>  Welcome to the first puppet show RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/478dade6befd3d0649f8274f058a5180.webp?t=1778784716\" width=18 height=18 /></span>  Battle tons of foes, buy new upgrades, cast magic and recruit new Heroes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/045c76fb5de4db43b5203ff25ed7c6a6.webp?t=1778784716\" width=18 height=18 /></span>  Or just sit back as your Heroes do the fighting while you relax or do other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/236bc5a90f84f91c903e5a5d6b9547ad.webp?t=1778784716\" width=18 height=18 /></span>  But just remember that you need to make sure your heroes are strong enough before you leave them to their own, especially if you are about to face a Boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/733c918eef6d032ae99801683fe28d66.webp?t=1778784716\" width=18 height=18 /></span>  Enjoy the show!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/bc84e8bb2c4e5e47f60d7632a958f5af.avif?t=1778784716\" width=576 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 different enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Distinct group of heroes with different abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting powers to unleash on your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix of RPG and clicker grind elements with tons of skills to upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions of any sort</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possibly infinite gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppet stage graphics with cute puppet heroes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/Bosses.PNG?t=1778784716\" /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/e7b8cbf438a6b67aa3168fd20379672e.avif?t=1778784716\" width=614 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/369b863b5e236f5f2be3f4703ea2d6f4.webp?t=1778784716\" width=18 height=18 /></span>  Welcome to the first puppet show RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/478dade6befd3d0649f8274f058a5180.webp?t=1778784716\" width=18 height=18 /></span>  Battle tons of foes, buy new upgrades, cast magic and recruit new Heroes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/045c76fb5de4db43b5203ff25ed7c6a6.webp?t=1778784716\" width=18 height=18 /></span>  Or just sit back as your Heroes do the fighting while you relax or do other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/236bc5a90f84f91c903e5a5d6b9547ad.webp?t=1778784716\" width=18 height=18 /></span>  But just remember that you need to make sure your heroes are strong enough before you leave them to their own, especially if you are about to face a Boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/733c918eef6d032ae99801683fe28d66.webp?t=1778784716\" width=18 height=18 /></span>  Enjoy the show!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/bc84e8bb2c4e5e47f60d7632a958f5af.avif?t=1778784716\" width=576 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 different enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Distinct group of heroes with different abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting powers to unleash on your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix of RPG and clicker grind elements with tons of skills to upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions of any sort</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possibly infinite gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppet stage graphics with cute puppet heroes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371570/extras/Bosses.PNG?t=1778784716\" /></span></p>",
